</head><body><a class="skip-link" href="#main-content">Skip to main content</a><header class="site-header" data-site-header><div class="site-header__inner shell"><a class="brand-link" href="/" aria-label="NovaDot home"><img class="brand-logo" src="/brand/novadot-full-logo-footer-transparent.png" srcset="/brand/novadot-full-logo-footer-transparent.png 1x, /brand/novadot-full-logo-footer-transparent-2x.png 2x" width="720" height="280" alt="NovaDot"></a><nav class="desktop-nav" aria-label="Primary navigation"><a href="/">Home</a><a href="/services/">Services</a><a href="/events/">Events &amp; Space</a><a href="/how-we-work/">How We Work</a><a href="/about/">About</a></nav><a class="button button--primary header-cta" href="/contact/">Discuss your project</a><button class="menu-toggle" type="button" aria-label="Open navigation menu" aria-controls="mobile-navigation" aria-expanded="false" data-menu-toggle><span aria-hidden="true"></span><span aria-hidden="true"></span><span aria-hidden="true"></span></button></div></header><nav id="mobile-navigation" class="mobile-nav" aria-label="Mobile navigation" hidden data-mobile-nav><div class="shell mobile-nav__inner"><a href="/">Home</a><a href="/services/">Services</a><div class="mobile-nav__services" role="group" aria-label="Service areas"><a href="/services/software-ai-business-systems/">Software, AI &amp; Business Systems</a><a href="/services/web-mobile-digital-growth/">Web, Mobile &amp; Digital Growth</a><a href="/services/cloud-security-it-operations/">Cloud, Security &amp; IT Operations</a></div><a href="/events/">Events &amp; Space</a><a href="/how-we-work/">How We Work</a><a href="/about/">About</a><a href="/contact/">Contact</a><a class="button button--primary" href="/contact/">Discuss your project</a></div></nav><script type="module">var e=document.querySelector(`[data-menu-toggle]`),t=document.querySelector(`[data-mobile-nav]`);if(e instanceof HTMLButtonElement&&t instanceof HTMLElement){let n=[document.querySelector(`.skip-link`),document.querySelector(`main`),document.querySelector(`footer`)].filter(e=>e instanceof HTMLElement),r=e=>{n.forEach(t=>{t.inert=e})},i=(n=!1)=>{let i=e.getAttribute(`aria-expanded`)===`true`;e.setAttribute(`aria-expanded`,`false`),e.setAttribute(`aria-label`,`Open navigation menu`),t.hidden=!0,document.body.classList.remove(`menu-open`),r(!1),n&&i&&e.focus()};e.addEventListener(`click`,()=>{let n=e.getAttribute(`aria-expanded`)!==`true`;e.setAttribute(`aria-expanded`,String(n)),e.setAttribute(`aria-label`,n?`Close navigation menu`:`Open navigation menu`),t.hidden=!n,document.body.classList.toggle(`menu-open`,n),r(n)}),t.querySelectorAll(`a`).forEach(e=>e.addEventListener(`click`,()=>i())),document.addEventListener(`keydown`,n=>{if(n.key===`Escape`&&i(!0),n.key===`Tab`&&e.getAttribute(`aria-expanded`)===`true`){let r=[e,...t.querySelectorAll(`a`)],i=r[0],a=r.at(-1);n.shiftKey&&document.activeElement===i?(n.preventDefault(),a?.focus()):!n.shiftKey&&document.activeElement===a&&(n.preventDefault(),i.focus())}}),window.matchMedia(`(min-width: 960px)`).addEventListener(`change`,e=>{e.matches&&i()})}</script><main id="main-content"><section class="page-hero page-hero--compact"><div class="shell page-hero__compact-inner"><div class="page-hero__copy"><p class="eyebrow">Legal &amp; Privacy</p><h1>Privacy Policy</h1><p class="page-hero__lead">NOVADOT LTD is committed to protecting your privacy and handling personal data with transparency, integrity and accountability.</p></div></div></section><section class="content-section" aria-labelledby="policy-overview-title"><div class="shell content-grid"><p class="content-grid__aside">Data controller</p><div class="prose"><h2 id="policy-overview-title">Who we are</h2><p>This website is operated by <strong>NOVADOT LTD</strong> (company registration number 07691369), with registered office at 21 Berkeley Close, Oadby, Leicester, England, LE2 4SZ and office address at First Floor, 18B Tithe Street, Leicester, LE5 4BN. Under UK data protection law (UK GDPR and the Data Protection Act 2018), we are the data controller for personal data collected through this website.</p><p>For privacy enquiries, contact<a class="text-link" href="mailto:hello@novadot.co.uk">hello@novadot.co.uk</a>.</p></div></div></section><section class="content-section content-section--porcelain" aria-labelledby="data-collection-title"><div class="shell content-grid"><p class="content-grid__aside">Information we collect</p><div class="prose"><h2 id="data-collection-title">Information we collect and why</h2><p>We deliberately minimise the personal data we collect. We do not use third-party analytics trackers, advertising networks, or unnecessary marketing scripts.</p><h3>1. Direct project and event enquiries</h3><p>When you use our project enquiry form, event form, or contact us via email or telephone, we collect:</p><ul><li>Your name, work email address, telephone number (if provided), and organisation name;</li><li>Details of the project, system, event topic or space requirements you share with us; and</li><li>Communication history regarding your enquiry.</li></ul><p>When you submit a project or event enquiry, our website sends your details securely to NovaDot's Microsoft 365 email mailbox. SiteGround provides the website hosting and Microsoft provides the email service. We use your email address to reply to your enquiry. The website does not keep a separate database of enquiry messages or add you to a marketing list.</p><p>To limit spam and duplicate messages, the website temporarily keeps hashed request identifiers and network addresses with timestamps. These records expire after 24 hours and are cleared when subsequent submissions are processed; they do not include your enquiry text.</p><p><strong>Legal basis:</strong> Processing is based on our legitimate interest in assessing and responding to your enquiry, or taking preliminary steps at your request prior to entering into an agreement.</p><h3>2. Technical server logs</h3><p>Our hosting infrastructure records standard technical request logs (such as IP address, browser user-agent, and request timestamp) strictly for server security, diagnostic monitoring, and network defence.</p><p><strong>Legal basis:</strong> Legitimate interests in securing our digital infrastructure against abuse and unauthorised access.</p><h3>3. Cookies</h3><p>This website does not deploy tracking, advertising, or third-party analytical cookies. We do not require a cookie banner because no intrusive or non-essential cookies are placed on your device.</p></div></div></section><section class="content-section" aria-labelledby="retention-title"><div class="shell content-grid"><p class="content-grid__aside">Retention & security</p><div class="prose"><h2 id="retention-title">Data retention and security</h2><p>Enquiry records that do not lead to an engagement are archived and securely deleted after 12 months. Client project data and correspondence are retained in accordance with UK statutory accounting, legal, and contractual limitation periods (typically 6 years from project completion).</p><p>We apply robust technical and organisational security controls, including encrypted transport (HTTPS/TLS), access limitations restricted to authorised personnel, and protected hosting and email services.</p></div></div></section><section class="content-section content-section--porcelain" aria-labelledby="rights-title"><div class="shell content-grid"><p class="content-grid__aside">Your rights</p><div class="prose"><h2 id="rights-title">Your statutory rights</h2><p>Under UK data protection law, you have the right to:</p><ul><li>Request access to the personal data we hold about you;</li><li>Request correction of inaccurate or incomplete personal records;</li><li>Request erasure of your personal data where retention is no longer justified;</li><li>Object to or request restriction of our processing of your information; and</li><li>Lodge a complaint with the UK supervisory authority, the <strong>Information Commissioner's Office (ICO)</strong> at <a class="text-link" href="https://ico.org.uk">ico.org.uk</a>.</li></ul><p>To exercise any of these rights, please contact us at <a class="text-link" href="mailto:hello@novadot.co.uk">hello@novadot.co.uk</a>.</p></div></div></section></main><footer class="site-footer" data-astro-cid-nns7i3if><div class="shell footer-grid" data-astro-cid-nns7i3if><div class="footer-brand" data-astro-cid-nns7i3if><a class="brand-link" href="/" aria-label="NovaDot home" data-astro-cid-nns7i3if><img class="brand-logo" src="/brand/novadot-full-logo-dark-theme.png" srcset="/brand/novadot-full-logo-dark-theme.png 1x, /brand/novadot-full-logo-dark-theme-2x.png 2x" width="720" height="280" alt="NovaDot" data-astro-cid-nns7i3if></a><p data-astro-cid-nns7i3if>NovaDot helps UK organisations plan, build, improve and support software, systems and digital services.</p></div><div class="footer-links" data-astro-cid-nns7i3if><div data-astro-cid-nns7i3if><h2 data-astro-cid-nns7i3if>Work</h2><a href="/services/" data-astro-cid-nns7i3if>Services</a></div><div data-astro-cid-nns7i3if><h2 data-astro-cid-nns7i3if>Company</h2><a href="/events/" data-astro-cid-nns7i3if>Events &amp; Space</a><a href="/how-we-work/" data-astro-cid-nns7i3if>How We Work</a><a href="/about/" data-astro-cid-nns7i3if>About</a></div><div data-astro-cid-nns7i3if><h2 data-astro-cid-nns7i3if>Contact</h2><a href="/contact/" data-astro-cid-nns7i3if>Contact</a></div><div data-astro-cid-nns7i3if><h2 data-astro-cid-nns7i3if>Legal</h2><a href="/privacy-policy/" data-astro-cid-nns7i3if>Privacy Policy</a><a href="/terms/" data-astro-cid-nns7i3if>Terms</a></div></div></div><div class="shell footer-legal" data-astro-cid-nns7i3if><p data-astro-cid-nns7i3if>© 2026 NOVADOT LTD. Registered in England and Wales. Company number 07691369.</p></div></footer></body></html>